title: "Rehab-Immersive: a framework to support the development of virtual reality applications in upper limb rehabilitation"
abstract: "Virtual reality framework for upper limb rehabilitation in patients with spinal cord injury, including a demonstrator application of the Box and Block Test for Oculus Quest 2 with kinematics tracking and patient-specific customisation."
